# Core

Dominant cost: **tool results** / repeated exploration, not reply length.

## Project

- **Stack:** Quasar 2 + Vue 3 + TS in `web/`; Supabase in `supabase/`.
- **Surfaces:** `platform` | `app` | `shop` | `investor`.
- **Modules:** `web/src/modules/<name>/` — page → store/service → repository (or composable + repository).
- **Writes:** prefer RPCs when RLS is computed; types via migrations + `backend:types` (grep `database.types.ts`, never full-read).
- **Schema:** `supabase/schemas/`; never full-read `public.sql` or bulk-read migrations. Scope column is `tenant_id` (`parent_tenant_id` retired).
- **Local DB:** `pnpm run backend:local` after migrations. Never auto `backend:reset` / `restore-dumps` / `pull-prod-data` — `supabase-local-backend.mdc`.
- **Product:** prefer module `spec.md` + code; if unclear ask **one** question. Do not invent statuses/RPCs.
- **UI:** `quasar-ui.mdc` + `docs/guides/OpsListPage.skeleton.vue`. Never open mega list pages for chrome.
- **Conventions detail:** `.development-flow.mdc` when needed.

## Response

- Start with answer or code. No preamble/sign-off. Agent wrap-up: **Done** (`mode-responses.mdc`).
- Patches: 3–5 lines context; elide with `// ... existing code`.
- Scope: >3 files or >150 lines → pause. **UI chrome only** (Tf/spacing/shell/tokens; no product invent): up to **8 files / 400 lines**. Max 2 alternatives; pick one.
- User text: short; meaning first. Uncertain value → `// ⚠️ verify:` inline.

## Tools

| Need | Use | Avoid |
|------|-----|-------|
| Exact symbol | Grep | Speculative tour |
| File by name | Glob | Recursive list-all |
| How X works | Search, then targeted read | 10 speculative files |
| Known file | Read offset/limit | Full 1k+ line file |
| RPC/column | Grep types or `schemas/<domain>/` | Full `database.types.ts` / `public.sql` |

- Batch independent tool calls. Never re-read unchanged files.
- Path given → start there. Error string → grep it first.
- No full test/lint suite for trivial edits; no dev server unless asked.
- Stop when done.

## Context / diff

- Files >500 lines: grep ±20. No `operating_manual` / `docs/product-scenarios/` unless user asks.
- Touch only what the task needs. In-scope dead imports only.
